{"overview":"ماجراهای دکتر، یک بیگانۀ انسان‌نما که در زمان سفر می‌کند و به عنوان «تای لرد» شناخته می‌شود. او در TARDIS خود، سفینه‌ای هوشیار و زمان‌سفر، جهان را کاوش می‌کند. ظاهر آن به شکل یک جعبه پلیس آبی بریتانیایی است که در سال ۱۹۶۳، زمانی که سریال اولین بار پخش شد، رایج بود. همراه با هم‌پیروان متعددی، دکتر با انواع دشمنان روبه‌رو می‌شود و در تلاش برای نجات تمدن‌ها، کمک به مردم عادی و اصلاح اشتباهات است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The adventures of The Doctor, a time-traveling humanoid alien known as a Time Lord. He explores the universe in his TARDIS, a sentient time-traveling spaceship. Its exterior appears as a blue British police box, which was a common sight in Britain in 1963 when the series first aired. Along with a succession of companions, The Doctor faces a variety of foes while working to save civilizations, help ordinary people, and right many wrongs.","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":1384,"y":1991,"poster":"/6b4ZxsefmnYJbtToLSmtzcH8xtG.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":42,"y":1963,"poster":"/kMsl0FngCuWPUzfpLvCnIMpciv2.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":39,"y":1964,"poster":"/qmFTV4IS9nJvGrGyEOSm1AwgVwR.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":45,"y":1965,"poster":"/wxcz4Cmi08ldjlnzyxuvwfP8OWf.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":43,"y":1966,"poster":"/4nuXzilSKXDEev1rM1NWJ9O5HWw.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":40,"y":1967,"poster":"/iiVKKWgDSjcfLWjUlANFWcrkoHd.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":44,"y":1968,"poster":"/nO47cTkvyFBlIsHTArx1hVYT6uB.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":25,"y":1970,"poster":"/zCucGEayzCNI8nq1FkBDGsJhm51.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":25,"y":1971,"poster":"/ytNZ3Ijh29K3hX5pzmT3nDHzFNe.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":26,"y":1972,"poster":"/oPchakHiVUF6AsxkeKhjVXynCiK.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":26,"y":1972,"poster":"/oSns2NL99UyJGhbjtlgMmQCzmXR.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":26,"y":1973,"poster":"/uj9fdKn8E6gI2UmNRZpAmvahepN.jpg"},{"n":12,"name":"فصل 12","ep":20,"y":1974,"post